{"desc": "This Pattern was posted by chase2k25. Tagged with: pattern, dark, black, gradient, abstract, gold, pattern, speckled.", "image": "/data/library-cache/files/b71d06f9441de0bdc0cf.jpg", "tailwind": false, "html": "<div class=\"starfield-sparkle\">\n  <span class=\"orbit-overlay\"></span>\n  <svg class=\"texture-filter\">\n    <filter id=\"starfield-texture\">\n      <feTurbulence\n        type=\"fractalNoise\"\n        baseFrequency=\"0.1\"\n        numOctaves=\"8\"\n        result=\"noise\"\n      ></feTurbulence>\n      <feGaussianBlur\n        in=\"noise\"\n        stdDeviation=\"0.5\"\n        result=\"blur\"\n      ></feGaussianBlur>\n      <feSpecularLighting\n        in=\"blur\"\n        surfaceScale=\"2\"\n        specularConstant=\"1.5\"\n        specularExponent=\"30\"\n        lighting-color=\"#ffcc33\"\n        result=\"specular\"\n      >\n        <fePointLight z=\"100\" y=\"50\" x=\"50\"></fePointLight>\n      </feSpecularLighting>\n      <feComposite\n        in=\"specular\"\n        in2=\"SourceGraphic\"\n        operator=\"over\"\n        result=\"lit\"\n      ></feComposite>\n      <feBlend in=\"SourceGraphic\" in2=\"lit\" mode=\"hard-light\"></feBlend>\n    </filter>\n  </svg>\n</div>\n", "css": ".starfield-sparkle {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    to top,\n    rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) 0%,\n    rgb(0, 0, 0) 50%,\n    rgb(0, 0, 0) 100%\n  );\n  filter: url(#starfield-texture);\n  position: relative;\n  animation: twinkle 3s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n", "license": "mit"}